[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0134","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0134.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0304","title":"Caucho Resin 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Caucho Resin 1.2.2 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 URL 请求中插入 \"\\..\" 特殊字符序列绕过路径限制，实现跨目录读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于对用户输入路径过滤不严，攻击者可利用此漏洞获取敏感配置文件、源代码等未授权信息，危害等级中等。建议升级至 Resin 1.2.3 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0304"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:03Z","remediation":"升级 Caucho Resin 至 2.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层面配置 URL 重写规则，拦截包含 \"\\..\" 或 \"../../\" 等目录遍历特征的请求路径，阻止恶意路径穿越攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98229372610440&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2384","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20635","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0304.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0304","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0304.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0304.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-23m7-3cfp-h2gf/GHSA-23m7-3cfp-h2gf.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/resin_traversal.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0304.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2384/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a3491bee-a