dBlue 1.02.07 Personal Edition 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0277"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:00Z","remediation":"升级 BadBlue 至 1.02.8 或更高版本（厂商已在该版本中修复 ext.dll 缓冲区溢出问题）；如无法升级，在 Web 服务器前端防火墙或反向代理中拦截对 /ext.dll 路径的 HTTP GET 请求，限制超长 URI 的传入。该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至活跃维护的 Web 服务器软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98263019502565&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2392","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20641","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0277.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0277","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0277.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0277.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h396-vrvv-r9h5/GHSA-h396-vrvv-r9h5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0277.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--abc55a7f-6e2a-4af6-befc-3ba10b50991a.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls