06-16T21:54:00Z","remediation":"升级 Marconi Forethought 操作系统至最新版本（若仍受厂商支持）；在网络边界防火墙配置规则，丢弃含有 SYN-FIN 和 More Fragments 标记的异常数据包；限制仅受信 IP 地址可访问设备的 Telnet（23/TCP）和 Web 管理（80/TCP）接口；如不必要，建议关闭 Telnet 和 Web 管理服务，仅通过串行控制台或 SSH 进行管理操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0349.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2400","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20644","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0270.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0270","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0270.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0270.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x33m-hv2q-xjf3/GHSA-x33m-hv2q-xjf3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2400/info.html","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/marconi_dos.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0270.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0095","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0236","title":"Sun Solaris snmpXdmid 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统中 snmpXdmid（SNMP 到 DMI 映射守护进程）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标主机的 snmpXdmid 服务发送超长特制的 \"indication\" 事件数据包触发栈溢出，从而在目标系统上以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.6、7.0 及 8.0 版本，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级严重。Metasploit 框架已集成相应利用模块，攻击者可便捷实施远程入侵。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0236"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:56Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Sun 官方补丁 106874-04 (Solaris 2.6) / 106875-04 (Solaris 7) / 108811-04 (Solaris 8)，或升级至更高版本。如无法打补丁，可在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释 snmpXdmid 行并重启 inetd 以禁用该服务，同时配置防火墙过滤 UDP 161/162 端口限制 SNMP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98462536724454&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/207","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-05.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-065.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2417","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6245","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20649","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2001/CVE-2001-0236.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0236.json","https://github.com/x0rz/EQGRP/blob/0c2354ff1073099b2aa417030b3167ec29d7279c/README.md","https://github.com/stg-tud/cveenhance/blob/6476e73d87cdc9cf610342ef15d131432ab41588/Annotations/Wollny/CVE-2001-0236.xml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/5462df1242ecdfa07cb8ddac80e6ca8fcb2b6836/2001/CVE-2001-0236.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f9d39cb51fb060741ef320624becd6ee37aff12/2001/CVE-2001-0236.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/8cb689fefe08504a48f3f2c38f38147822007cd6/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/snmpXdmid.nasl","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b555